<title>ISRAEL: Mofet Q3 net 10.7 million shekels.</title>
<headline>Mofet Q3 net 10.7 million shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mofet Israel Technology Fund Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>				 (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96	Q3 95    9-MTH 96   9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue     17,717  342 23,079     1,951</p>
<p>Pre-tax Profit     15,498   Loss531    17,913   Loss557</p>
<p>Net Profit	     10,697   Loss531    13,213   Loss557</p>
<p>($1 = 3.24 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
